<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP article</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong> Standard</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> a computer program that creates computer generated worlds based on paintings. A portal then opens into the world and people and objects can enter.<br />
•Radio waves can’t travel through the portal<br />
•The computer doesn’t function unless within the place it was found<br />
•An unknown hostile group is within some of the worlds<br />
•The origin is unknown</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> In the form of exploration logs MTF would go in and see if there are limits, and come across a person inside and conducts an interview. Then they go into a few optical illusions to take measurements, and come across the hostile group the third time around, getting rescued by a second MTF.</p>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong> the exploration logs will be of the differing landscapes, and there would be recurring characters.</p>

